               <extent xml:id="extent_1de36fa4">12 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_aff54d56">27 x 36.5 </dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_20f6a1da">3 bifolios stitched together. Written in brown ink with numerous corrections in pencil. Paper: 14 staves. Title page and eleven numbered pages. Title above the second movement added in pencil: "Sang uden Ord" (Song without Words). Title above third movement added in pencil: "Gamle Minder" (Old Memories). At the end of the music on p. 11 signed and dated: "I:P:E: Hartmann d. 31 Marts 1851. / Op: 53". Opus number cancelled in pencil. Various fragments added after the final stave on p. 11.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
